cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it together with the UPENN-GBM dataset."
title: "Reproduction code for: Incremental value of MRI radiomics for overall survival in glioblastoma (UPENN-GBM cohort)"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the manuscript "MRI 影像组学对胶质母细胞瘤总生存期的增量价值：
  UPENN-GBM 队列分析". It covers cohort manifest and registration quality control,
  PyRadiomics feature extraction (IBSI fixed bin count, binCount=64), nested
  patient-grouped cross-validation modelling, patient-level bootstrap, calibration
  with bootstrap intervals, MGMT association decomposition, feature selection
  stability and sensitivity analyses.
